        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I think this behaviour is not quite ideal: When using `gopls` (and possibly other LSPs) it has any buffer in the workspace with diagnostics open as an unlisted buffer. I can not properly open those and afaict there is no way to instruct mini.files to list them. I end up running `:e` every time.\r\n\r\nI'd like to request an option to list previously unlisted buffers when opening from `mini.files`. I'm also open to work on this myself if you concur about the inclusion in principle but don't want to spend the time on it :)",
